{"lang":"zh","dir":"ltr","title":"Vizcay Landscaping | 加州瓦卡维尔草坪、铺砖与园林设计","body":"<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">跳到主要内容</a>\n<header class=\"topbar\">\n  <div class=\"wrap topbar-in\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#top\"><span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">V</span><span>Vizcay Landscaping</span></a>\n    <nav class=\"nav\"><a href=\"#about\">关于我们</a><a href=\"#services\">服务</a><a href=\"#faq\">常见问题</a><a href=\"#gallery\">照片</a><a href=\"#reviews\">评价</a><a href=\"#visit\">营业时间和地址</a></nav>\n    <label class=\"lang-pick\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20 10 10 0 0 0 0-20zm6.9 6h-2.9a15.7 15.7 0 0 0-1.4-3.6A8 8 0 0 1 18.9 8zM12 4c.8 1.2 1.5 2.5 1.9 4h-3.8c.4-1.5 1.1-2.8 1.9-4zM4.3 14a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0-4h3.4a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0 4H4.3zm.8 2h2.9c.3 1.3.8 2.5 1.4 3.6A8 8 0 0 1 5.1 16zM8 8H5.1a8 8 0 0 1 4.3-3.6C8.8 5.5 8.3 6.7 8 8zm4 12c-.8-1.2-1.5-2.5-1.9-4h3.8c-.4 1.5-1.1 2.8-1.9 4zm2.3-6H9.7a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0-4h4.6a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0 4zm.3 5.6c.6-1.1 1.1-2.3 1.4-3.6h2.9a8 8 0 0 1-4.3 3.6zM16.3 14a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0-4h3.4a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0 4h-3.4z\"/></svg><select id=\"langSel\" aria-label=\"语言\"><option value=\"en\" lang=\"en\">English</option><option value=\"es\" lang=\"es\">Español</option><option value=\"tl\" lang=\"tl\">Tagalog</option><option value=\"vi\" lang=\"vi\">Tiếng Việt</option><option value=\"zh\" lang=\"zh\" selected>中文</option><option value=\"pa\" lang=\"pa\">ਪੰਜਾਬੀ</option><option value=\"hi\" lang=\"hi\">हिन्दी</option><option value=\"ko\" lang=\"ko\">한국어</option><option value=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">العربية</option></select></label>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17075900660\">报价</a>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main id=\"main\">\n<section class=\"hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"hero-bg\" style=\"background-image:url('images/turf-front-yard.jpg')\"></div>\n  <div class=\"wrap hero-in\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">园林绿化 · 瓦卡维尔与迪克森</p>\n    <h1>Vizcay Landscaping</h1>\n    <p class=\"tagline\">前院和后院改造：人造草坪、铺砖、灌溉、植物和耐旱设计，由 Nick 和他的团队完成。</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-meta\"><a class=\"rating-badge\" href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/vizcay-landscaping-vacaville-3#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>5.0 · Yelp 上的 58 条评价<span class=\"ext\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><span class=\"open-badge\" id=\"openBadge\" hidden></span></div>\n    <div class=\"cta-row\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"tel:+17075900660\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.5c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.3 0 .7-.2 1l-2.3 2.2z\"/></svg> 致电获取报价</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=Vizcay%20Landscaping%2C%20Vacaville%2C%20CA%2095696\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.2 7 13 7 13s7-7.8 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 12 6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z\"/></svg> 地图</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stripe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"highlights\"><div class=\"wrap\"><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/vizcay-landscaping-vacaville-3#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">58 条评价，5.0★</a></li><li>人造草坪与草地</li><li>铺砖与硬景观</li><li>灌溉</li><li>园林设计</li><li>每天保持工地整洁</li></ul></div></div>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"about\"><div class=\"wrap about-grid\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">我们的团队</p><h2>邻居路过都要停下来看的院子。</h2><p>Vizcay Landscaping 是一家总部位于瓦卡维尔的园林承包商，服务瓦卡维尔、迪克森及索拉诺县周边地区。Nick Vizcay 和他的团队承接完整的前院和后院项目，从拆除、清运旧混凝土，到铺砖、灌溉、草坪、植物和树皮覆盖。</p><p>我们在 58 条评价中获得 5 星。客户称赞我们沟通顺畅、团队准时、设计建议很有价值，而且每天收工时院子都干干净净、没有杂物。</p><div class=\"facts\"><a class=\"fact\" href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/vizcay-landscaping-vacaville-3#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>5.0★</b><span>58 条评价</span></a><div class=\"fact\"><b>58 条中 57 条</b><span>五星评价</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><b>周一至周五</b><span>上午 7 点至晚上 7 点</span></div></div></div><div class=\"about-img\"><img src=\"images/drought-tolerant.jpg\" alt=\"种满耐旱植物的前院\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"services\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">服务项目</p><h2>我们的服务</h2></div><div class=\"services\"><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">01</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>园林设计</h3></div><p>帮你完善想法，提供你可能没想到的设计建议。</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">02</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>人造草坪</h3></div><p>适用于前院、后院和狗狗活动区的草坪。</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">03</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>草坪铺设</h3></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">04</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>铺砖施工</h3></div><p>铺砖露台和步道。</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">05</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>灌溉系统安装</h3></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">06</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>植物种植与树皮覆盖</h3></div><p>包括耐旱景观。</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">07</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>整院翻新</h3></div><p>拆除并清运旧混凝土、草坪和植物，然后重新施工。</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">08</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>园林照明</h3></div></article></div><p class=\"note\">每个院子都不一样，所以没有公开价目表。请致电 (707) 590-0660 获取报价。</p></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"amenities\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">温馨提示</p><h2>温馨提示</h2></div><ul class=\"amenities\"><li><b>服务瓦卡维尔与迪克森</b><span>索拉诺县</span></li><li><b>设计建议</b><span>我们帮你完善想法</span></li><li><b>工地整洁</b><span>每天收工都清理干净</span></li><li><b>紧急服务</b></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"gallery\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">相册</p><h2>近期作品</h2></div><div class=\"gallery\"><figure><img src=\"images/curb-turf.jpg\" alt=\"车道旁的前院草坪\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/front-yard-lighting.jpg\" alt=\"黄昏亮灯的前院景观\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/backyard-turf.jpg\" alt=\"后院人造草坪\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/xeriscape-bed.jpg\" alt=\"铺有树皮和石头的花坛\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/lawn-edge.jpg\" alt=\"步道旁弯曲的草坪边缘\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/front-lawn.jpg\" alt=\"前院草坪铺设\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/drought-tolerant.jpg\" alt=\"耐旱植物种植\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/turf-front-yard.jpg\" alt=\"完工的前院草坪\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">评价</p><h2>顾客怎么说</h2></div><div class=\"ratings\"><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">5.0</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Yelp</b> · 58 条评价</div><a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/vizcay-landscaping-vacaville-3#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">在 Yelp 上查看更多评价 →</a></div></div></div><div class=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“If I could give Nick 100 Five-star ratings I would! He is kind, helpful, creative, hard-working and always shows up in an emergency ( like a missing broken valve that the previous owner buried in a mystery location in our yard!) He installed our landscaping in both our front and back yards. They are so stunning that neighbors walking their dogs stop to tell us they purposely walk down our street so they can see our yard. (BTW if Nick suggests adding lighting... don&#39;t hesitate!)”</blockquote><figcaption>— BestProsInTown reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.bestprosintown.com/ca/dixon/vizcay-landscaping-/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BestProsInTown</a> · Jul 2023</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Nick and his crew recently redid our entire backyard landscaping, from the demolition and removal of existing concrete, lawn, and plants, through the installation of pavers, plants, bark,...”</blockquote><figcaption>— Kali J. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/vizcay-landscaping-vacaville-3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · Jun 2023</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“My yard is beautiful. It&#39;s just what I wanted. Viscay Landscaping can be characterized by excellence, trust, and timeliness. Very responsive to ideas and requests. Nick Viscay and his crew and subcontractors were all very professional, polite, and effective. I highly recommend him.”</blockquote><figcaption>— BestProsInTown reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.bestprosintown.com/ca/dixon/vizcay-landscaping-/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BestProsInTown</a> · Oct 2023</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Vizcay Landscaping did an amazing job at transforming our weed ridden front yard (knee high weeds after the rain) into a beautiful drought resistant landscape. The &quot;before&quot; picture is actually...”</blockquote><figcaption>— Susan S. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/vizcay-landscaping-vacaville-3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · Apr 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Nick and his team did an amazing job! Great communication back and forth with quality service. They went the extra mile on our turf job and left the yard clean and debris free each day. I highly...”</blockquote><figcaption>— Nick R. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/vizcay-landscaping-vacaville-3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · Jan 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“I recently had the pleasure of working with Vizcay Landscaping for a major landscaping project, and I cannot recommend them highly enough! From the moment I reached out, their team was incredibly fast and responsive, setting the tone for a truly exceptional experience. Everyday they arrived on time, fully equipped, and ready to tackle the job. Their team communicated with me every step of the way, ensuring I was informed and comfortable with the progress. It&#39;s clear that they value their customers! One of the standout aspects of this company was the valuable input they provided. They helped me refine my initial ideas, suggesting designs that I had not considered...”</blockquote><figcaption>— BestProsInTown reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.bestprosintown.com/ca/dixon/vizcay-landscaping-/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BestProsInTown</a> · May 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“I will say that working with Nick was probably one of my best experiences with a &quot;contractor&quot; and owner. He and his crew was always on time, professional and very reliable. Nick was also quick and...”</blockquote><figcaption>— Giemar F. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/vizcay-landscaping-vacaville-3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · May 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Recently we just completed a full front and backyard renovation with Vizcay Landscaping. It was an absolute pleasure to work with Nick and his whole team throughout the process. We called at...”</blockquote><figcaption>— Cassi M. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/vizcay-landscaping-vacaville-3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · Feb 2022</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">常见问题</p><h2>常见问题解答</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>你们服务哪些地区？</summary><p>我们服务索拉诺县的瓦卡维尔和迪克森。</p></details><details><summary>你们做哪些项目？</summary><p>园林设计、人造草坪、草坪铺设、铺砖、灌溉、植物和树皮覆盖，直到从清除旧混凝土、草坪和植物开始的整个前后院翻新。</p></details><details><summary>你们做耐旱园林吗？</summary><p>做！我们已经把不少前院改造成了耐旱景观。</p></details><details><summary>怎么获取报价？</summary><p>请致电 (707) 590-0660，周一至周五上午 7 点至晚上 7 点。</p></details><details><summary>我会和谁对接？</summary><p>你会直接和我——Nick Vizcay——以及我的团队合作，从头到尾沟通顺畅。</p></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"visit-info\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">服务范围</p>\n      <h2>营业时间和服务范围</h2>\n      <address>服务地区：Vacaville, Dixon &amp; Solano County<br>位于 Vacaville, CA 95696</address>\n      <p><a class=\"phone-link\" href=\"tel:+17075900660\">(707) 590-0660</a></p>\n      <table class=\"hours\" id=\"hoursTable\"><tr data-d=\"1\"><td>星期一</td><td>7 AM – 7 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"2\"><td>星期二</td><td>7 AM – 7 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"3\"><td>星期三</td><td>7 AM – 7 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"4\"><td>星期四</td><td>7 AM – 7 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"5\"><td>星期五</td><td>7 AM – 7 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"6\"><td>星期六</td><td>休息</td></tr><tr data-d=\"0\"><td>星期日</td><td>休息</td></tr></table>\n      <p class=\"note\">致电获取报价。上门服务，没有门店。</p>\n      <div class=\"socials\"><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/vizcay-landscaping-vacaville-3#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.6-5.7 4.9 1.8 7.3L12 17.8 5.4 21.7l1.8-7.3L1.5 9.5 9 8.9z\"/></svg><span>Yelp</span></a></div>\n      <div class=\"cta-row\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17075900660\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.5c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.3 0 .7-.2 1l-2.3 2.2z\"/></svg> 致电</a>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-outline\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=Vizcay%20Landscapin